	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Use `sl` to browse aliases. The selected alias ID is saved as a workflow variable, then Alfred starts a blank recipient input. Use `slc` to browse aliases and contacts. Use `slnew` to choose a suffix and enter a custom alias prefix. `slsetup` offers Install / Update, Log In, and Log Out. Log In uses Alfred text input; the token is visible while entered and may be saved in Alfred history. Errors produce a notification and an Alfred Large Type message. Set `UV` to the uv executable; `SIMPLELOGIN_CLI` defaults to `./.venv/bin/sl`.</string>
